  ['The Last Stand of Stonehaven','The prophecy does not say Stonehaven will fall. It says the bells will ring until no hand remains to pull the rope. It says the fields will burn and the northern road will disappear beneath the feet of an army. Yet the final line has never been translated the same way twice: “Stonehaven shall perish,” or “Stonehaven shall be remembered.”'],
